## Affected Component / Version

- **Package:** `com.fasterxml.jackson.core:jackson-core`
- **Confirmed against:** `jackson-core-2.20.2`
- **Affected file:** `src/main/java/com/fasterxml/jackson/core/io/NumberInput.java`
